## Phase 8 — core/router.py + core/synthesizer.py

```
Build core/router.py and core/synthesizer.py.

core/router.py:
- async def classify(state: PitambarState) -> PitambarState
- Reads router_prompt.txt from llm/prompts/
- Calls call_llm(router_prompt, state["query"])
- Strips any markdown/backtick wrappers before json.loads
- On JSON parse failure: fallback {"intent":"crop","entities":[],"agents_needed":["crop"]}
- If intent == "multi" and agents_needed is empty: set agents_needed to all four agents
- If intent is single: set agents_needed to [intent]
