- async def synthesize(state: PitambarState) -> PitambarState
- If only one agent result: set final_response = that result's "result" directly, skip LLM call
- If multiple results: build combined string of all agent outputs labeled by agent name
- Read synthesis_prompt.txt
- Call call_llm(synthesis_prompt, combined_string)
- Set state["final_response"] to LLM output
- Return updated state

